		{
			dependencies: [
				"028B0660FD4BDF35"
			]
			description: [
				"Aluminium supports turn up to 512 RPM with no drag at all, and nothing aluminium ever weathers. But its shafts and cogs carry only light loads, and it melts beside anything &6Hot&r: lava, fire, a lit Furnace, a Blaze Burner or molten metal. A melted part runs down and sets as rough aluminium."
				""
				"Its pipes hold only &eWarm&r fluids, and its tanks make no boiler. Keep it out of the furnace yard."
				""
				"Every aluminium bracket and casing needs a Polyethylene Bushing, so aluminium parts wait for the Steel Furnace chapter."
			]
			id: "44DB9B8C2FC1DCE2"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "Steel's speed, no drag, and a weakness"
